{
  "song_id": 2289056,
  "title": "Poo-Putt Platter",
  "language": "en",
  "lyricists": [
    70
  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "skit",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I tripped a lot out here in the woods lately, ugh!",
          "rhyme": "yg",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "This is a platter of... this makes an, an exceptionally good late night's snack and also a dandy fly swatter",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Ah, my eyes are going, I can't hit it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Nothing comes between me and my masters",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "(What is it father?)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "These footprints were by th— flying monkey men",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "(But they've never strayed from the Valley since we made the pig feet)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Yes, that is what disturbs me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "He'd probably get indigestion",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "You will go",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "(I don't think so",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Take them)",
          "rhyme": "Em",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "This jungle is dangerous —rapper",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "You will need assistance",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "(I know what I'm doing)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "You risked your life for us, thanks",
          "rhyme": "#k",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "I lost an arm",
          "rhyme": "uRm",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "(Good)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "Stop it, father!",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "(Stand back!",
          "rhyme": "ak",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Return to the house)",
          "rhyme": "awz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "No",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "What the?",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Now —rapper, perhaps you will listen",
          "rhyme": "En",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCDEFEGHIIJBKELMENOPIQF",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCDEFEGHIIFBJEJKEFLLILF"
    }
  ]
}